SUMMARY:CASA Family Movie Day
DESCRIPTION:Join CASA at Penn Cinema for CASA Family Movie Day! This year’s movie is Toy Story 5 and we couldn’t be more excited! Tickets are $5 each and include an in-theater popcorn bar and bottled water. Any other food and drink may be purchased from Penn Cinema concessions. Tickets can be purchased through our exclusive Penn Cinema ticketing link. We will have a table outside the theater where you can learn more about CASA! All children should be accompanied by a responsible adult. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/casa-family-movie-day/
LOCATION:Penn Cinema\, 541 Airport Rd\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
