SUMMARY:Greenfield 2026 Summer Concert Series: Sounds of Summer
DESCRIPTION:Your favorite summer anthems — live and under the sun. \n\n\n\nIn partnership with Prima Theatre\, this high‑energy concert transforms Greenfield into a sun‑drenched\, beach‑side bash\, featuring top‑tier talent performing the season’s most iconic feel‑good hits. Think “Surfin’ U.S.A.\,” “Margaritaville\,” “Three Little Birds\,” “Soak Up the Sun\,” and “Can’t Stop the Feeling!” — a joyful burst of rhythm\, movement\, and pure summer fun. \n\n\n\nThis concert is FREE and open to all. No tickets required.  \n\n\n\n\nConcert begins at 7:30 PM (held rain or shine!)\n\n\n\nFood Trucks will be on site by 5:00 PM – expected vendors are…\n\nGourmet Julie’s Way\n\n\n\nStoney’s Burgers and Fries\n\n\n\nRad-ish\n\n\n\nG’s Concessions\n\n\n\nGreco’s\n\n\n\nCupcakes by Casey\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNEW THIS YEAR! All concerts take place at Greenfield\, right across from the Calvin G. High Pavilion (1828 William Penn Way). Grab your friends\, bring your lawn chairs\, and settle in for summer nights filled with great music and great company! \n\n\n\nProductions by Prima Theatre \n\n\n\n\n    Learn more
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/greenfield-2026-summer-concert-series-sounds-of-summer/
LOCATION:Calvin G. High Pavilion\, 1828 William Penn Way\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/avif:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/sounds-of-summer-logo.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Greenfield":MAILTO:greenfieldinfo@high.net
END:VEVENT
