SUMMARY:Lancaster International Piano Competition Final with Lancaster Symphony Orchestra
DESCRIPTION:Witness the next generation of piano virtuosos performing concertos with the Lancaster Symphony Orchestra! For the first time ever\, the Lancaster International Piano Competition finalists will perform live in concert with Lancaster Symphony orchestra for a thrilling final round of competition. Each finalist will perform 1 concerto movement for the final round: Hung-Ching Chou – Prokofiev Piano Concerto No. 3 in C\, Op. 26 “Andante – Allegro”\, Jiarui Li – Beethoven Piano Concerto No. 4 in G major\, Op.58\, “Allegro moderato”\, Jihee Moon – Prokofiev Piano Concerto No. 3 in C\, Op. 26 “Andante – Allegro”\, Fiona Wu – Chopin Piano Concerto No. 2 in F minor\, Op. 21 “Allegro Vivace” \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-international-piano-competition-final-with-lancaster-symphony-orchestra/
LOCATION:Barshinger Center at F&M College\, College Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/LIPF-133-under-8mb-scaled.avif
