SUMMARY:LIPF Presents: Daniel Browell
DESCRIPTION:Join acclaimed pianist Daniel Browell for a captivating program bridging the classical and the contemporary\, featuring works by Schubert\, Cheryl Frances-Hoad\, John Buckley\, and Andrew Hamilton. \n\n\n\nAbout the Artist\n\n\n\nDaniel Browell has performed to critical acclaim across the UK\, Europe\, China\, and North America\, with notable appearances at London’s Purcell Room and Manchester’s Bridgewater Hall. \n\n\n\nA passionate champion of contemporary music\, Daniel is a core member of the Belfast-based Hard Rain SoloistEnsemble. His extensive career includes live broadcasts on BBC Radio 3 and performances at international festivals in Berlin\, Beijing\, and London’s Royal Festival Hall. He has collaborated with the BBC Philharmonic\, the Ulster Orchestra\, and soprano Kathryn Rudge at Wigmore Hall. \n\n\n\nDaniel studied at the Royal Academy of Music and the University of Birmingham\, and later served as a Junior Fellow at the Royal Northern College of Music. Currently the Associate Head of Keyboard at the Royal Birmingham Conservatoire\, he regularly delivers international masterclasses and serves on the jury of the Dudley International Piano Competition. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lipf-presents-daniel-browell/
LOCATION:Barshinger Center at F&M College\, College Avenue\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Daniel-Browell-LIPF.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Lancaster International Piano Festival":MAILTO:lancasterpianofestival@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
